    "chunk_text": "beon gelic his Gehyron we nu, men \u00fea leofestan, hw\u00e6t awriten is on Godes bocum, \u00fe\u00e6t se mon se \u00fee god onginne\u00fe Ac se \u00fee god onginne\u00fe, & on \u00feon \u00feurhwuna\u00fe o\u00fe ende his lifes, se bi\u00f0 hal geworden. For\u00feon we habba\u00fe ned\u00feearfe \u00fe\u00e6t we ongyton \u00fea blindnesse ure \u00e6l\u00feeodignesse; we send on \u00feisse We synd on \u00feisse worlde \u00e6l\u00feeodige, & swa w\u00e6ron si\u00fe\u00feon se \u00e6resta ealdor \u00feisses menniscan cynnes & for\u00feon gylte we w\u00e6ron on \u00feysne wr\u00e6csi\u00fe sende, & nu eft sceolon o\u00feerne e\u00feel secan, swa wite, swa Gif we willa\u00fe nu on Drihten gelyfan, & hine ongytan, \u00feonne beo we sittende be \u00fe\u00e6m wege, swa se \u00de\u00e6t is \u00feonne \u00fe\u00e6t we sceolon \u00feone geleafan & \u00fe\u00e6t ondgit mid godum d\u00e6dum gefyllan, \u00feonne beo we Her us cy\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t se godspellere s\u00e6de hu Drihten cw\u00e6\u00fe to Petre, \u00fea he b\u00e6d \u00fe\u00e6t he moste faran & his H\u00e6lend him \u00fea ondswarede & cw\u00e6\u00fe, \u00feu scealt fylgean me, & l\u00e6tan \u00fea deadan bergean heora deade. On \u00feon he us bysene onstealde \u00fe\u00e6t n\u00e6nig mon ne sceal lufian ne ne geman his gesibbes, gif he hine Ge\u00feencean we eac \u00fe\u00e6t Drihten his englas gesceop, & heofen & eor\u00fean, s\u00e6, & ealle \u00fea gesceafta \u00fee on Hw\u00e6\u00feere he hine to \u00feon geea\u00femedde for u",
